## Cleaning summary


After removing exact duplicates, the original dataset contained **22,743 rows
and 6 columns**. The final cleaned dataset prepared for keyword analysis
contains **6,525 rows and 9 columns**.

A total of **16,218 rows**, or approximately **71.3% of the dataset**, were
excluded from the keyword analysis.

> **Most of the excluded rows were administrator or chatbot responses rather
> than messages written by customers.**

Because the goal of this project is to identify customer concerns, product
questions, and campaign-related interest, the keyword analysis focuses only on
useful customer-written messages. Advertisement-entry text, empty messages,
personal-information placeholders, and low-information responses such as
“yes,” “okay,” and “correct” were also excluded because they do not independently
describe a customer concern.

Although the number of excluded rows is large, this reduction is reasonable
for the project goal. The original dataset remains unchanged, and the excluded
administrator and chatbot messages can still be used later for conversation-flow
or chatbot-performance analysis.